{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barocss/barocss/issues/2236","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barocss/barocss","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barocss/barocss/issues/2236/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barocss/barocss/issues/2236/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barocss/barocss/issues/2236/events","html_url":"https://github.com/barocss/barocss/issues/2236","id":6092407469,"node_id":"I_kwDON66n_c8AAAABayLCrQ","number":2236,"title":"[P2] fix(studio): preserve canonical keys when reading project snapshots","user":{"login":"easylogic","id":591983,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MTk4Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/591983?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/easylogic","html_url":"https://github.com/easylogic","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easylogic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easylogic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easylogic/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easylogic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easylogic/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easylogic/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easylogic/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easylogic/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easylogic/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-29T03:54:59Z","updated_at":"2026-10-29T04:10:36Z","closed_at":"2026-10-29T04:10:36Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 문제\n\n현재 schema 3 문서의 선택 필드 `nextId`를 생략한 snapshot을 프로젝트 버전으로 저장하면, 재열기에서 canonical 내용 키가 달라져 버전 로그가 거부됩니다.\n\n- 로컬 검증 SHA: `5463dbf32af5dd10670badd0d334c68504615292`.\n- 기존 로드맵: `EA-20261029/A04`, 12 CG6 versions/snapshots. 관련 연구 #2217.\n- 검증: 실제 Model version API와 Studio project codec을 memoryStore에서 실행했습니다. UI와 물리 파일 handle 검사는 아닙니다.\n\n## 재현\n\n1. `emptyDoc()`의 선택 필드 `nextId`만 생략합니다. schema 3, mm, nodes와 parameters는 유지합니다.\n2. 실제 `makeVersions`로 첫 버전을 만듭니다.\n3. 실제 `writeVersions(memoryStore, 'omitted.bcad', log)` 후 `readVersions`를 호출합니다.\n4. 같은 원본을 `encodeStudioSnapshot/readStudioSnapshot`으로 읽는 대조군과 비교합니다.\n\n기대: 프로젝트 버전의 원래 canonical 키와 필드 생략 상태를 보존합니다.\n\n실제:\n\n```text\n.barocss/versions/omitted.bcad.json: [VERSION_LOG] the snapshot d57d5d923d188d43 does not match its content (versions.0)\n```\n\n원래 키는 `d57d5d923d188d43`입니다. 일반 reader가 `nextId: 0`을 보충한 문서의 키는 `4273ff7287232d91`입니다. 전용 snapshot codec 대조군은 원본과 생략을 보존하며 통과합니다.\n\n## 원인과 완료 기준\n\n`apps/cad-studio/src/storage/project.ts:48,60`은 snapshot에도 일반 파일 codec을 사용합니다. `readDoc:28 → readStudioFile → migrate.ts:58 → withIds`가 정규화한 문서를 `checkVersions`에 전달합니다. Model의 전용 snapshot API는 `engine/container.ts:115–126`에 이미 있습니다.\n\n- 버전 snapshot을 전용 encode/read codec에 연결하세요. 일반 Open 정규화는 유지해야 합니다.\n- 생략, false, 0, 빈 자료의 canonical 동일성과 원래 키를 확인하세요.\n- 현재 schema 3/4를 유지하세요. 새 schema나 가상 legacy 변환은 이 문제의 해결 조건이 아닙니다.\n\n일반 UI는 nextId를 채우는 경우가 많으므로 모든 프로젝트가 실패한다는 뜻은 아닙니다. reader가 반환한 문서의 canonical identity가 바뀐 것이며 저장 bytes가 읽기 중 변경됐다는 뜻도 아닙니다. 주 파일 손실과 raw-byte 동일성은 입증하지 않았습니다.\n\n로컬 증거: `/Users/user/Documents/ChatGPT/barocss/.omx/research/cad-commercial-readiness-20261029/{harness/model-readiness.ts,runs/model-001/harness.json}`. 기존 선택 검사 10/10은 통과했지만 이 새 경계 재현은 실패합니다. 별도 분석자가 입력의 현재 계약 적합성을 확인했습니다.\n","closed_by":{"login":"easylogic","id":591983,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MTk4Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/591983?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/easylogic","html_url":"https://github.com/easylogic","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easylogic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easylogic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easylogic/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easylogic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easylogic/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easylogic/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easylogic/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easylogic/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/easylogic/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barocss/barocss/issues/2236/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barocss/barocss/issues/2236/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/us